<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - Aug 1.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - Aug 1.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   98/100   100/102    UNQ    165/169</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	 101/104   103/106  175/180  180/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was quiet on Friday amid poor  enquiries ahead of the weekend, traders said. Offers were $1-$2 per  tonne lower than previous levels but still failed to attract shipowners,  they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
